Patched Wine (WineCX) binaries
------------------------------

The app bundle ships these prebuilt Wine files, copied into the WineCX engine at
setup. Each is built from CodeWeavers' winecx source, as rebased by dappermint
(https://github.com/dappermint/winecx) and packaged as a runtime by
https://github.com/dappermint/winecx-gptk, with a patch from this repository.
Wine is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or
later (LGPL-2.1-or-later); these files keep that license. Wine's license notice
and the LGPL-2.1 text ship in the app as LICENSE.wine. Build recipes and
sha256 pins are in docs/WINECX.md and each patch directory's README.

  WineCX 11.17 (winecx e0aa380780b73e20fabcfe78fd42713b94929a53, runtime 4.7.3):
    win32u-winecx-11.17.so        win32u-patch/patch-driver-version.sh (binary
                                  string edit of the runtime's win32u.so)
    winemac-winecx-11.17.so       winemac-patch/winecx-11.17-d3dmetal-retina.patch
    winebus-winecx-11.17.so       unmodified source, built with SDL2 support
    winebus-winecx-11.17.sys      winebus-patch/winecx-sdl-mappings.patch
    winecoreaudio-winecx-11.17.so winecoreaudio-patch/winecx-render-buffer.patch
    wined3d-winecx-11.17.dll      wined3d-patch/winecx-driver-version.patch
    ws2_32-winecx-11.17.dll       ws2_32-patch/winecx-own-hostname.patch
    d3dx11_43-winecx-11.17.dll    d3dx11-patch/winecx-create-thread-pump.patch
    d3dx11_43-winecx-11.17-i386.dll  (same patch)
    d3dx11_42-winecx-11.17.dll    (same patch)
    d3dx11_42-winecx-11.17-i386.dll  (same patch)
    crypt32-winecx-11.17.dll      ngx-signer-patch/winecx-ngx-signer.patch
    wintrust-winecx-11.17.dll     ngx-signer-patch/winecx-ngx-signer.patch
    kernel32-winecx-11.17.dll     hide-wine-exports-patch/winecx-hide-wine-exports.patch
    kernelbase-winecx-11.17.dll   hide-wine-exports-patch/winecx-hide-wine-exports.patch

  WineCX 11.15 (winecx 5b45f4564c4f87fa9c0f958733a5e9bb3918a058, runtime 4.5.125):
    winemac-winecx-11.15.so       winemac-patch/winecx-d3dmetal-retina.patch
